Z||000003||DXR_DAD||03-31-2001||06:54 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://wsphotofews.excite.com/007/RM/lB/e0/qF55872.jpg"> <P>I would go to a local upholstery shop and get the glue! Doing the dash is something I still need to do. The shift pod is covered.<BR>It's a process of heat and stretching to get it this smooth. I may just have the dash dyed the light gray or just have  the top, the dark recovered with the light? also I still need to do the headliner. I hade this done at a local upholstery shop, and it came out great!!!!!, it still looks as good as the day I put it in  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
